  "body_html": "<p>Experience personalized comfort with the Jeminise Baseball Bedding Comforter Set. This set is perfect for baseball enthusiasts, offering a unique way to showcase your love for the sport with custom name options. Designed for softness and durability, it transforms any bedroom into a fan's dream.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Ideal for baseball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating determination and passion for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features an environmental protection finishing process that helps fabric hold dye and prevents fading, ensuring longevity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric for a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel, with Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; can be air dried without heat for quick drying and to maintain fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization:</strong> Includes options for 2 text inputs for personalization.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons, providing comfort year-round.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
